# Language policy — Ollanta Tours

- The site supports **only English (EN) and Spanish (ES)** via the header language switch.
- **Never** put Czech (or any other language) into UI copy, tour names, locations, FAQs, footers, marquee text, alt text, or HTML placeholders.
- When the user sends text in Czech (or another language), **translate it** into both EN and ES and store it in `script.js` i18n (`en` / `es`).
- Default visible fallback text in HTML should be **English**.
- Spanish keys live under `i18n.es`; English under `i18n.en`. Keep both in sync whenever adding or editing copy.
